rec('DDQ-11','Recurring themes across the investment DDQs are firm ownership/organisation and financial stability; team experience, staffing and succession; fund/vehicle strategy and investment process; portfolio construction, exposures and risk; track record/performance; terms, fees, expenses and alignment/conflicts; governance, compliance and legal history; valuation/accounting and reporting; operations, service providers and technology/security; liquidity/leverage; and ESG/responsible investment and diversity in the questionnaires that address them. These are overlapping themes, not a checklist present in every document: real-estate DDQs, insurance-manager questionnaires and ESG-specific material have different emphases.',['ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','ILPA__ILPA_Due','INREV__INREV_DDQ_Non','INREV__INREV-DDQ-2022','AC_Private_Markets','NJEDA','SAA__'],[ev('ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','Firm Governance / Risk / Compliance'),ev('ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','Succession Planning / Key Persons'),ev('ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','Accounting / Valuation'),ev('INREV__INREV_DDQ_Non','a vehicle’s strategy, risk processes, management, terms and (projected) performance;'),ev('INREV__INREV_DDQ_Non','an investment manager’s structure, non-listed real estate business and track record;'),ev('INREV__INREV_DDQ_Non','the operational processes required to manage a vehicle.'),ev('INREV__INREV-DDQ-2022','Investment Management Process','table of contents'),ev('AC_Private_Markets','Operations & Liquidity'),ev('NJEDA','Respondent Firm: Diversity and Inclusion'),ev('SAA__','Performance Interrogatories','section V')],'Reviewed headings/question content across ILPA v1.2/2.0, INREV 2018 and 2022, Calamos/Aksia, NJEDA and SAA, and PRI/ILPA ESG support publications. Legacy INREV .doc lacks fresh verified text. Broad question admits multiple valid taxonomies; no universal coverage claim.', 'medium'),
rec('DDQ-14','No adoption count as of 2024 is stated in the corpus. ILPA DDQ 2.0 describes its voluntary standardization purpose and adoption prospectively; the September 2024 ESG Framework FAQ is not a census of DDQ adopters.',['ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','ILPA__240901'],[ev('ILPA__ILPA-DDQ-2.0','the ILPA DDQ is not intended to be a required document that all GPs must adopt.'),ev('ILPA__240901','The Framework was first released in 2021 and most recently revised in September of 2024.')],'Reviewed adoption references in DDQ, PRI and all ILPA publications; searched ILPA references across remaining corpus. No numerical GP-adoption statistic. Do not infer adoption from resource lists, participants or framework revision date.'),
